      "mergeID": "5c99598e466faa02fcba3a05",
      "mergedPostDetails": "I think its sometimes really annoying to always create a new world because if i want to Change from Friends+ to Invite i would need to rejoin the World etc.\n\nWhy dont you just create a little Button where the World Owner can change the world private status while on the same map.. it would also save some Server Traffic",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Change World Private Status \"on the fly\"",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "5b982aeb888e196b48135e4e",
      "private": false,
      "spam": false,
      "synthetic": true,
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-09-11T20:51:55.338Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So I already know I'm not alone here. You're in a world that you really like and your with some friends. Say you're the owner of a friends only world. Well your friends want to invite some people. Now you have to go and find the world again, drop a new portal, and wait to load into the same world you were in. Well that was a good waste of time. I think VRChat should implement a live status swap for worlds. Ex: Go from Private to Friends+ without restarting the world or going to a new instance via portal.\nThis would make life in VRChat alot easier.",
